    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n18238" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">fissūra</span></b> , ae, f.
		findo; <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a cleft</i>, <i>chink</i>, <i>fissure</i> (post-Aug.): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">quorum in digitos pedum fissura divisa est,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					10, 63, 83, § 176</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">vitis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Col.
					4, 29, 4</span></i>
			.—In plur., <i><span class="en">Plin. 33,
				6, 33, § 101</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">efficax asini sevum labrorum fissuris,</span>”
				<i>chapped lips</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					28, 12, 50, § 188</span></i>
			.</div>
